00:58:40.600 --> 00:58:42.540
<v David Sedaris>Is Sacajawea a province?

00:58:42.540 --> 00:58:47.410
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories from This American Life.

00:58:47.410 --> 00:58:56.340
<v David Sedaris>What about Mandingo?

00:58:56.340 --> 00:59:01.340
